<title>BELGIUM: EU monetary meeting over, announcement at 1700 GMT.</title>
<headline>EU monetary meeting over, announcement at 1700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's monetary committee meeting on linking the Finnish markka to the exchange rate mechanism is over and an announcement is expected at around 1700 GMT, EU sources said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Members of the committee left the building where they had been meeting but would not comment.</p>
<p>Brussels newsroom: + 32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
